WEBVTT

00:00:00.562 --> 00:00:01.150
Hello!

00:00:01.174 --> 00:00:04.430
Gift cards bring money in up front, and new customers too:

00:00:04.720 --> 00:00:06.750
people buy them for friends and family,

00:00:06.700 --> 00:00:09.390
and the person who receives one comes to your salon.

00:00:09.739 --> 00:00:14.430
Let me show you how to create, send, and redeem gift cards on VaraaAi.

00:00:15.094 --> 00:00:16.268
Tap Gift cards.

00:00:16.471 --> 00:00:18.508
First, create a card template:

00:00:18.743 --> 00:00:19.868
tap New template.

00:00:20.181 --> 00:00:23.704
Choose the Service, give the card a name, and enter the discount,

00:00:23.654 --> 00:00:25.948
how many days it's valid after activation,

00:00:26.217 --> 00:00:28.668
how many times it can be used, and its price.

00:00:28.937 --> 00:00:30.908
Then tap Create template.

00:00:31.574 --> 00:00:34.277
With a template ready, send a card to a customer.

00:00:34.626 --> 00:00:39.747
Under Send a gift card, choose the template, and enter the recipient's name, email,

00:00:39.697 --> 00:00:41.397
and a message for the card.

00:00:41.792 --> 00:00:46.197
If the customer has already paid, tick Paid, activate the card now.

00:00:46.546 --> 00:00:49.477
Then tap Create card image and email it.

00:00:49.906 --> 00:00:53.317
The customer receives a beautiful card image, with a QR code.

00:00:53.955 --> 00:00:57.416
When a customer brings their card, go to Check and redeem a card.

00:00:57.752 --> 00:01:00.836
Scan the QR code on the card with your phone camera,

00:01:00.786 --> 00:01:02.936
or type the code and tap Check code.

00:01:03.418 --> 00:01:07.496
The card appears, showing whether it's still valid, and how many uses are left.

00:01:07.845 --> 00:01:10.056
Tap Record a use, and you're done.

00:01:10.653 --> 00:01:13.100
Below is the list Cards sold and sent.

00:01:13.363 --> 00:01:17.580
Here you can view a card, download its image, or resend the email.

00:01:17.929 --> 00:01:20.540
Cards customers buy on your website appear here too:

00:01:20.889 --> 00:01:22.860
tap Confirm payment to activate them.

00:01:23.179 --> 00:01:24.620
Now take the quiz below.
